{
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "start",
   "type": "InitialNode",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 0,
   "props": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "c_title",
   "type": "CommentBlock",
   "x": 400,
   "y": -100,
   "props": {
    "Comment": "Lab 9 - gyroscope parameters\nOne run: 2 min warm-up, 3 min static log, then the rotation run\n(sine and square wave, amplitude 30 -> 60 -> 150 %), 3 s rest.\nThe robot only logs. All calibration and fitting is done offline\nin Gyro_parameters.ipynb."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "init",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 100,
   "props": {
    "Body": "-- geometry from Lab 5, used offline: r = 0.042 m, B = 0.194 m\nphase = \"init\"\nu = 0\nt = 0\nt0 = 0\nA = 0\nn = 0\nbuf = \"\"\ngzcal = 0\ngzraw = 0\ntus = 0\nline = \"# t_us,phase,u,gz_cal,gz_raw,encL,encR\\n\""
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_init",
   "type": "CommentBlock",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 100,
   "props": {
    "Comment": "Variables:\nphase - label written in every CSV line\nu     - commanded wheel power, % (right wheel; left gets -u)\nt     - seconds since the phase started\nt0    - phase start, ms\nA     - amplitude of the rotation signal, %\nn     - samples waiting in buf\nbuf   - CSV lines not yet written to the card\ngzcal - gyroscope rate, mdeg/s\ngzraw - uncalibrated gyroscope output, counts\ntus   - timestamp, us"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "rm",
   "type": "TrikRemoveFile",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 200,
   "props": {
    "File": "lab9_gyro.csv"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_rm",
   "type": "CommentBlock",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 200,
   "props": {
    "Comment": "Write To File appends, so the old log is removed first.\nThe file lands in the robot's scripts folder."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "hdr",
   "type": "TrikWriteToFile",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 300,
   "props": {
    "File": "lab9_gyro.csv",
    "Text": "line"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "clr",
   "type": "TrikV62ClearEncoder",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 400,
   "props": {
    "Ports": "E3, E4"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "p_warm",
   "type": "TrikPrintText",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 500,
   "props": {
    "PrintText": "warmup - do not touch",
    "FontSize": "20"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "t_warm",
   "type": "Timer",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 600,
   "props": {
    "Delay": "120000"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_warm",
   "type": "CommentBlock",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 500,
   "props": {
    "Comment": "Warm-up: 2 min, motors off, not logged.\nA MEMS gyro needs to reach thermal equilibrium before its\noffset is stable. Do not touch the robot or the table."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "p_static",
   "type": "TrikPrintText",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 700,
   "props": {
    "PrintText": "static - 3 min",
    "FontSize": "20"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "f_static",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 800,
   "props": {
    "Body": "phase = \"static\"\nu = 0\nt0 = time()"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "l_static",
   "type": "PreconditionalLoop",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 900,
   "props": {
    "Condition": "time() - t0 < 180000"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_static",
   "type": "CommentBlock",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 700,
   "props": {
    "Comment": "Static run: 3 min, motors off, logged.\nGives the offset b0, the drift d, the resolution and the noise sigma."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "s_static",
   "type": "TrikSystem",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1000,
   "props": {
    "Code": "true",
    "Evaluate": "false",
    "Command": "gzraw = brick.gyroscope().readRawData()[2];"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "g_static",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1100,
   "props": {
    "Body": "gzcal = gyroscope[2]\ntus = time() * 1000\nline = tus .. \",\" .. phase .. \",\" .. u .. \",\" .. gzcal .. \",\" .. gzraw .. \",\" .. encoder4 .. \",\" .. encoder3 .. \"\\n\"\nbuf = buf .. line\nn = n + 1"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "if_static",
   "type": "IfBlock",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1200,
   "props": {
    "Condition": "n >= 200"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "w_static",
   "type": "TrikWriteToFile",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 1300,
   "props": {
    "File": "lab9_gyro.csv",
    "Text": "buf"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "r_static",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 1400,
   "props": {
    "Body": "buf = \"\"\nn = 0"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "fi_static",
   "type": "FiBlock",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 1500,
   "props": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "t_static",
   "type": "Timer",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1600,
   "props": {
    "Delay": "10"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_log",
   "type": "CommentBlock",
   "x": 700,
   "y": 1000,
   "props": {
    "Comment": "One sample every ~10 ms:\n  System Call reads the uncalibrated gyro output (blocks cannot),\n  Expression builds the CSV line and appends it to buf.\nEvery 200 samples buf is written to the card in one go, so file\nI/O does not stretch the sampling period."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "p_sin",
   "type": "TrikPrintText",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1700,
   "props": {
    "PrintText": "sin - 36 s",
    "FontSize": "20"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "f_sin",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1800,
   "props": {
    "Body": "phase = \"sin\"\nt0 = time()"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "l_sin",
   "type": "PreconditionalLoop",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1900,
   "props": {
    "Condition": "time() - t0 < 36000"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_sin",
   "type": "CommentBlock",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 1700,
   "props": {
    "Comment": "In-place rotation, sine, period 4 s.\nAmplitude 30 % for 12 s, then 60 %, then 150 %.\n150 % is clipped to 100 % wheel power, so the robot turns at its\nmaximum rate and the gyro saturates - that is the point of the\nlast step (measurement range, section 3)."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "u_sin",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2000,
   "props": {
    "Body": "t = (time() - t0) / 1000\nA = 30 + 15 * (sgn(t - 12) + 1) + 45 * (sgn(t - 24) + 1)\nu = A * sin(2 * pi * t / 4)\nu = max(-100, min(100, u))"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "m3_sin",
   "type": "TrikV6EnginesForward",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2100,
   "props": {
    "Ports": "M3",
    "Power": "u"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "m4_sin",
   "type": "TrikV6EnginesBackward",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2200,
   "props": {
    "Ports": "M4",
    "Power": "u"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "s_sin",
   "type": "TrikSystem",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2300,
   "props": {
    "Code": "true",
    "Evaluate": "false",
    "Command": "gzraw = brick.gyroscope().readRawData()[2];"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "g_sin",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2400,
   "props": {
    "Body": "gzcal = gyroscope[2]\ntus = time() * 1000\nline = tus .. \",\" .. phase .. \",\" .. u .. \",\" .. gzcal .. \",\" .. gzraw .. \",\" .. encoder4 .. \",\" .. encoder3 .. \"\\n\"\nbuf = buf .. line\nn = n + 1"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "if_sin",
   "type": "IfBlock",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2500,
   "props": {
    "Condition": "n >= 200"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "w_sin",
   "type": "TrikWriteToFile",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 2600,
   "props": {
    "File": "lab9_gyro.csv",
    "Text": "buf"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "r_sin",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 2700,
   "props": {
    "Body": "buf = \"\"\nn = 0"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "fi_sin",
   "type": "FiBlock",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 2800,
   "props": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "t_sin",
   "type": "Timer",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2900,
   "props": {
    "Delay": "10"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "p_rect",
   "type": "TrikPrintText",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3000,
   "props": {
    "PrintText": "rect - 36 s",
    "FontSize": "20"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "f_rect",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3100,
   "props": {
    "Body": "phase = \"rect\"\nt0 = time()"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "l_rect",
   "type": "PreconditionalLoop",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3200,
   "props": {
    "Condition": "time() - t0 < 36000"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_rect",
   "type": "CommentBlock",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 3000,
   "props": {
    "Comment": "The same with a square wave: the robot spends most of the time\nat full turn rate, which shows whether the scale factor holds\nat high rate (section 6)."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "u_rect",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3300,
   "props": {
    "Body": "t = (time() - t0) / 1000\nA = 30 + 15 * (sgn(t - 12) + 1) + 45 * (sgn(t - 24) + 1)\nu = A * sgn(sin(2 * pi * t / 4))\nu = max(-100, min(100, u))"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "m3_rect",
   "type": "TrikV6EnginesForward",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3400,
   "props": {
    "Ports": "M3",
    "Power": "u"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "m4_rect",
   "type": "TrikV6EnginesBackward",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3500,
   "props": {
    "Ports": "M4",
    "Power": "u"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "s_rect",
   "type": "TrikSystem",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3600,
   "props": {
    "Code": "true",
    "Evaluate": "false",
    "Command": "gzraw = brick.gyroscope().readRawData()[2];"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "g_rect",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3700,
   "props": {
    "Body": "gzcal = gyroscope[2]\ntus = time() * 1000\nline = tus .. \",\" .. phase .. \",\" .. u .. \",\" .. gzcal .. \",\" .. gzraw .. \",\" .. encoder4 .. \",\" .. encoder3 .. \"\\n\"\nbuf = buf .. line\nn = n + 1"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "if_rect",
   "type": "IfBlock",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3800,
   "props": {
    "Condition": "n >= 200"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "w_rect",
   "type": "TrikWriteToFile",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 3900,
   "props": {
    "File": "lab9_gyro.csv",
    "Text": "buf"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "r_rect",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 4000,
   "props": {
    "Body": "buf = \"\"\nn = 0"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "fi_rect",
   "type": "FiBlock",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 4100,
   "props": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "t_rect",
   "type": "Timer",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 4200,
   "props": {
    "Delay": "10"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "stop",
   "type": "TrikV6EnginesStop",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 4300,
   "props": {
    "Ports": "M3, M4",
    "Mode": "float"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "p_rest",
   "type": "TrikPrintText",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 4400,
   "props": {
    "PrintText": "rest - 3 s",
    "FontSize": "20"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "f_rest",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 4500,
   "props": {
    "Body": "phase = \"rest\"\nu = 0\nt0 = time()"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "l_rest",
   "type": "PreconditionalLoop",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 4600,
   "props": {
    "Condition": "time() - t0 < 3000"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_rest",
   "type": "CommentBlock",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 4400,
   "props": {
    "Comment": "3 s at standstill, logged, so the final gyro and encoder angles\ncan be compared with the robot at rest."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "s_rest",
   "type": "TrikSystem",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 4700,
   "props": {
    "Code": "true",
    "Evaluate": "false",
    "Command": "gzraw = brick.gyroscope().readRawData()[2];"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "g_rest",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 4800,
   "props": {
    "Body": "gzcal = gyroscope[2]\ntus = time() * 1000\nline = tus .. \",\" .. phase .. \",\" .. u .. \",\" .. gzcal .. \",\" .. gzraw .. \",\" .. encoder4 .. \",\" .. encoder3 .. \"\\n\"\nbuf = buf .. line\nn = n + 1"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "if_rest",
   "type": "IfBlock",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 4900,
   "props": {
    "Condition": "n >= 200"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "w_rest",
   "type": "TrikWriteToFile",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 5000,
   "props": {
    "File": "lab9_gyro.csv",
    "Text": "buf"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "r_rest",
   "type": "Function",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 5100,
   "props": {
    "Body": "buf = \"\"\nn = 0"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "fi_rest",
   "type": "FiBlock",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 5200,
   "props": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "t_rest",
   "type": "Timer",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 5300,
   "props": {
    "Delay": "10"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "flush",
   "type": "TrikWriteToFile",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 5400,
   "props": {
    "File": "lab9_gyro.csv",
    "Text": "buf"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "sync",
   "type": "TrikSystem",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 5500,
   "props": {
    "Code": "true",
    "Evaluate": "false",
    "Command": "script.system(\"sync\", true);"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "p_done",
   "type": "TrikPrintText",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 5600,
   "props": {
    "PrintText": "done",
    "FontSize": "20"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "end",
   "type": "FinalNode",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 5700,
   "props": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "c_end",
   "type": "CommentBlock",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 5400,
   "props": {
    "Comment": "Write the last partial block, then sync so the file survives\na power-off. Copy lab9_gyro.csv off the robot and run the notebook."
   }
  }
